{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在電視劇《愛回家.開心速遞》飾演Andy的演員崔錦棠，今早（18日）駕駛比亞迪（BYD）私家車途經青衣楓樹窩路時發生車禍，攔腰撞落一輛的士的右邊車身，女司機一度昏迷被困，幸獲救後轉為清醒，送院治理。</p><p>意外中，崔錦棠的左手手腕受傷，一併送院；他在場向《香港01》記者講述事件，指事發在兩秒間的事，的士「突然間U-turn（掉頭）駛出‥‥‥冇expect（預期）可以咁樣。」</p><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠坐在石壆等候送院。（黃照緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166351395436105728691078.jpeg/Lfwx1h4M2DHPNiJV4Fe2Htg8y_N4Wqcp0IUYPumFGD4\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠坐在石壆等候送院。（黃照緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠手腕受傷，面露痛楚神情。（黃照緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166351398246420480573021.jpeg/vN5hP9EyyLnwhc4UH6bCeUwbYDYlWJt9egRhnEMEYZw\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠手腕受傷，面露痛楚神情。（黃照緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠接受酒精呼氣測試。（黃照緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166351401027375104278456.jpeg/6kW_F-RxwgY7jmfenYtkDtEhU-G5FqH_A_ZFtjr2RbY\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠接受酒精呼氣測試。（黃照緻攝）</figcaption></figure><p>崔錦棠穿着背心、短褲和波鞋，意外後坐在石壆等候，他手腕受傷，面露痛楚神情，經酒精測試和初步敷治後，由救護車送院。他向《香港01》記者稱：「我（駕車）直行，佢（的士）突然間U-Turn（掉頭）駛出嚟，傷咗手腕，其他地方應該無事。」</p><p>他隨後再補充說，的士由清心街右轉出楓樹窩路：「佢（的士）偷個路口（向右轉），冇expect（預期）可以咁樣，好短，兩秒都唔肯定。」</p><figure><img alt=\"的士右邊車身凹陷，安全氣袋彈出。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166353073816211456925041.jpeg/ir_l8XM63dZpUwqu83HZTglyf0HxbYVrhut9Fr_rfRY\"/><figcaption>的士右邊車身凹陷，安全氣袋彈出。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠手部受傷，在場接受檢查後送院。（ 黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166341007013318656294367.jpeg/r5u-abh9Dr6y9bx0iCfKxqqQTYlu6_WLqrMNN5OzDTc\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠手部受傷，在場接受檢查後送院。（ 黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"比亞迪（BYD）車頭損毀。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166342847209672704084561.jpeg/BUruuP_hGQUEnbCQXmDFuy-YvWGQf5Y8y1dh4eJXYeE\"/><figcaption>比亞迪（BYD）車頭損毀。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"的士右邊車身損毀氣袋彈出。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166347583069622272547219.jpeg/voqMHwXw3ehU8Gg54OXnec1KqbE5R-zGuaoq84CqKvM\"/><figcaption>的士右邊車身損毀氣袋彈出。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠在場接受檢查後送院。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166348116769640448420138.jpeg/chkV94_jdOSBROZrYaaQkykVDNFUZTddUznwfmo58H4\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠在場接受檢查後送院。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠在場接受檢查後送院。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166348119894528000468750.jpeg/nzcb-bOmW3AAZTpKGQjxSh5Fv9R5VXhsILT-jRm0_o0\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠在場接受檢查後送院。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠的座駕車頭損毀。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166348122453184512519784.jpeg/fDeD39qnXZmRic4cg7i6MPjRqGtc4PG2CNohHzHaIR8\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠的座駕車頭損毀。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"的士右邊車身損毀。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166348124961509376306159.jpeg/FtkUqnWkgWfvJEeUvKZIsYNGZq1oVvnTaO1vJ1Htbyc\"/><figcaption>的士右邊車身損毀。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"的士右邊車身損毀。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166348127583080448271348.jpeg/wsF5DBftvMjYV2maad9BB3E7pfDskyv1eLaIoEG2iKA\"/><figcaption>的士右邊車身損毀。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"的士女司機送院治理。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166355417429708800305768.jpeg/_Q6ChqRHV7U7nF62oKTTmgZjHOWDXE2KrvJw6pfycOo\"/><figcaption>的士女司機送院治理。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T04:20:02.632797+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":616,"images":13,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}